      "body": "It would make sense for taskbar ordering of apps to correspond to the apps in the niri scrolling desktop. When windows are moved in niri the taskbar should update to the new ordering and if possible dragging apps around in taskbar should move them in the desktop to the new location. \n\nI have no ideas how to best make this work with multiple workspaces. A option to have a dedicated taskbar for each?",
