        "patch_url": "https://github.com/Alexays/Waybar/pull/4395.patch",
        "merged_at": "2025-10-01T12:27:14Z"
      },
      "body": "This PR extends my work from #3868 by adding 2 config options that were requested [here](https://github.com/Alexays/Waybar/pull/3868#issuecomment-3193789696) and [here](https://github.com/Alexays/Waybar/pull/3868#issuecomment-3194003406):\r\n\r\n```jsonc\r\n\"hyprland/workspaces\": {\r\n    \"workspace-taskbar\": {\r\n        // If set to \"first\", the active window will be moved to the beginning of the taskbar.\r\n        // If set to \"last\", it will be moved to the end.\r\n        // It will only work if `update-active-window` is set to true.\r\n        // Allowed values: \"none\" (default), \"first\", \"last\".\r\n        \"active-window-position\": \"first\",\r\n        // If set to true, the taskbar windows will be added in reverse order (right to left if \"orientation\"\r\n        // is \"horizontal\", bottom to top if \"vertical\"). Default value: false.\r\n        \"reverse-direction\": true\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```",
